                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 79/118.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Riddle to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June 16,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Douma dissolved this morning by imperial proclamation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Riddle.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
